:: day0_library [nobr]
<<locationImage "grand_library" "Grand Library">>
<h2>📚 Grand Library</h2>
<p>Empty. Dawn light. The constellations turn in silence. Haeth is at his desk.</p>

<<if not $d0_npc_haeth>>
<div class="interaction-card main">
  <<npcPortrait "haeth" "Haeth">>
  <h4>📖 The Book Between the Pages</h4>
  <p>He's not cataloguing. He's watching the door. He was waiting for you.</p>
  [[Approach|day0_npc_haeth]]
</div>
<<else>>
  <p class="empty-note">Haeth has returned to his desk, spectacles on, exactly as he intends to remain.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Return to Palace Hub|day0_hub]]
</div>
